{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "IF WE MAKE IT HOME.",
    "steam_appid": 3736560,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736560/extras/d05e527882c7526201b4d193debb80df.avif?t=1749213707\" data-has-big width=800 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snipping. Pruning. Eating. <strong>At what point are you no longer human?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IF WE MAKE IT HOME. is a short narrative space thriller, where you will learn how far an AI suit will go to follow an order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736560/extras/569f9efff4b7bc78871b6006d8ed5862.avif?t=1749213707\" data-has-big width=800 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IF WE MAKE IT HOME.</strong> is a gripping narrative space thriller that explores the thin line between survival and self-destruction. In this game, you step into the boots of a lone spaceman, stranded on a desolate, windswept planet. Your only companion? An advanced, hyper-intelligent space suit, driven by a single, unbreakable directive: keep you alive at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But survival isn't always as simple as it sounds. The suit will <strong>snip away</strong> at your weakness, prune your fears, and consume what it must to keep you breathing. But what happens when the cost of survival becomes your very humanity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736560/extras/bd8f75262b5c83ddf8411e6aa1c69b3d.avif?t=1749213707\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736560/extras/59a531675a1665f03af035a732742673.avif?t=1749213707\" data-has-big width=800 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing around with a grapple hook, boost through the air with a jetpack, but at <strong>what cost to your energy</strong>? You decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision burns precious energy, and every action pulls you further from the person you once were. <strong>How far will you go to make it home?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736560/extras/487878968fb3de35494bd1010930011a.avif?t=1749213707\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736560/extras/0735a14cb690f8162f24cfd28e1ac6e7.avif?t=1749213707\" data-has-big width=800 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IF WE MAKE IT HOME. is a video game adaptation of 'The Suit', a comic created by <strong>Scott Base</strong> as part of his <strong>'Bad Space'</strong> collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Download IF WE MAKE IT HOME. for free on Steam, and dive deeper into Scott Base's mind by exploring the rest of the 'Bad Space' comics online.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736560/extras/d05e527882c7526201b4d193debb80df.avif?t=1749213707\" data-has-big width=800 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snipping. Pruning. Eating. <strong>At what point are you no longer human?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IF WE MAKE IT HOME. is a short narrative space thriller, where you will learn how far an AI suit will go to follow an order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736560/extras/569f9efff4b7bc78871b6006d8ed5862.avif?t=1749213707\" data-has-big width=800 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IF WE MAKE IT HOME.</strong> is a gripping narrative space thriller that explores the thin line between survival and self-destruction. In this game, you step into the boots of a lone spaceman, stranded on a desolate, windswept planet. Your only companion? An advanced, hyper-intelligent space suit, driven by a single, unbreakable directive: keep you alive at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But survival isn't always as simple as it sounds. The suit will <strong>snip away</strong> at your weakness, prune your fears, and consume what it must to keep you breathing. But what happens when the cost of survival becomes your very humanity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736560/extras/bd8f75262b5c83ddf8411e6aa1c69b3d.avif?t=1749213707\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736560/extras/59a531675a1665f03af035a732742673.avif?t=1749213707\" data-has-big width=800 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing around with a grapple hook, boost through the air with a jetpack, but at <strong>what cost to your energy</strong>? You decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision burns precious energy, and every action pulls you further from the person you once were. <strong>How far will you go to make it home?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736560/extras/487878968fb3de35494bd1010930011a.avif?t=1749213707\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736560/extras/0735a14cb690f8162f24cfd28e1ac6e7.avif?t=1749213707\" data-has-big width=800 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IF WE MAKE IT HOME. is a video game adaptation of 'The Suit', a comic created by <strong>Scott Base</strong> as part of his <strong>'Bad Space'</strong> collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Download IF WE MAKE IT HOME. for free on Steam, and dive deeper into Scott Base's mind by exploring the rest of the 'Bad Space' comics online.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
